@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我是<br>【看到远野汉娜<br>和夏目安安<br>离开以后】，<br>去了惩罚室。|#0102Trial05_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

